Implement direct Supabase uploads to bypass Vercel body size limit

- Add signed URL generation for direct browser-to-Supabase uploads
- Client now uploads directly to Supabase Storage (bypasses 4.5MB limit)
- 3-step flow: get signed URL -> upload to storage -> confirm metadata
- Keeps legacy direct upload as fallback for small files
- Supports up to 30MB file uploads without Vercel restrictions
